<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "IEEE 2881" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Learning Metadata" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE learning technology standard that defines an extensible set of metadata classes and properties for describing learning resources and learning events. Its model is designed to align with Resource Description Framework (RDF) approaches and can be represented in graph-oriented and other formats." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/scheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
