<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/activeDefinition> <https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms-1> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Shared metadata terms make learning resources and events easier to describe, discover, exchange, connect, and reuse across systems without forcing every platform to invent its own vocabulary." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-2881-2025-learning-metadata-terms/versions/1> .
